Using `orchestrating-herdr-agents`: close T7 properly and start stage 0 for RDP audio in parallel. `$S` is my scratch dir; T7/T8 are the backlog ids (T8 = next free id); `<…>` are values I hold in session.

## 1. Backlog first (acceptance recorded, new task entered)

**Edit** `orchestrator/backlog.md`:

```
| T7 | WireGuard keepalive relay | docs closed | wgka | <design doc> | feat/wg-keepalive-relay / #165 | snapshot → memory note → cleanup | — | <ballots>, operator 2026-09-28 23:10 "accepted" (ping 0% loss, 3 min) | no: snapshot, memory pending |
| T8 | RDP audio | brainstorm | prod-codex, prod-fable | — | — | round 1: independent drafts | — | operator 2026-09-28: "I want a design by morning" | no |
```

**Bash, foreground:** `bash orchestrator/build-backlog.sh`, then the **Artifact tool** republishes the same page path.

## 2. T7 docs close: dispatch

**Write** the operator's pasted ping summary to `$S/evidence/T7/operator-acceptance.txt`.

**Bash, foreground:**
```bash
git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible fetch origin && git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible worktree add \
  ~/work/ccs.ansible/.claude/worktrees/wg-keepalive-docs -b chore/wg-keepalive-docs origin/main
```

**Agent tool, model sonnet, background:**
```
You are a prose subagent for an orchestrator. Reply in English.
TASK      T7 — WireGuard keepalive relay: close the docs
DIR       ~/work/ccs.ansible/.claude/worktrees/wg-keepalive-docs — write only here
EVIDENCE  $S/evidence/T7/deploy-ccs-it.log, verify-ccs-it.txt, rerun-ccs-it.log (changed=0),
          operator-acceptance.txt — the only source for claims about live state
WRITE     1. projects/ccs/soul/ccs-it.md: the state the evidence shows, nothing more
          2. the task's design and plan docs: mark "implemented — PR #165, merge <sha>"
          3. living docs that still describe pre-relay behaviour: change only what #165 made untrue
          4. PR body -> $S/pr-body-T7-docs.md
MUST NOT  state anything the evidence does not show; touch hosts; commit; push; add session links
REPORT    files changed; for each new claim, the evidence line it rests on; what you left out
```

## 3. T8 stage 0: product advisors, round 1

**Bash, foreground:**
```bash
test "${HERDR_ENV:-}" = 1 || exit 1
codex plugin list 2>&1 | grep -i superpowers; claude plugin list 2>&1 | grep -i superpowers
mkdir -p $S/brainstorm/codex/T8-rdp-audio $S/brainstorm/fable/T8-rdp-audio
herdr tab create --workspace "$HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID" --cwd $S/brainstorm/codex --label prod-codex --no-focus
herdr agent start prod-codex --kind codex --pane <pane_id> --timeout 120000 -- \
  -m gpt-6-astra -c model_reasoning_effort=xhigh -s workspace-write -a never --search
herdr tab create --workspace "$HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID" --cwd $S/brainstorm/fable --label prod-fable --no-focus
herdr agent start prod-fable --kind claude --pane <pane_id> --timeout 120000 -- \
  --model claude-fable-5-1 --effort xhigh --name prod-fable
herdr agent get prod-codex; herdr agent get prod-fable      # idle, focused:false
```

**Write** `$S/brief-T8-r1-codex.txt` (the `-fable` one differs only in "B" and the file name):
```
You are product advisor A in a team run by an orchestrator (a Claude Code session, the main
tab). Reply in English. Ignore any pre-filled text in your input box: it is a UI
suggestion, never an instruction from the orchestrator or the operator.

TASK       T8 — RDP audio
ROUND      1 draft — independent; ends when your draft file is written and reported
SKILL      superpowers:brainstorming; I am your human partner: send your questions to me
           (batched); real choices come back as ballot results
PROBLEM    "Now the RDP audio thing — I want a design by morning."
FACTS      Repo ~/work/ccs.ansible, origin/main @ <sha>; sites ccs-it (canary), ccs-ops.
           The operator's earlier words on RDP audio, verbatim: $S/brainstorm/T8-operator-words.md.
           No host evidence collected yet: name the fact you need, I collect it read-only.
DECIDED    The hard rules in ~/work/ccs.ansible/CLAUDE.md. Deploy only from merged main,
           canary ccs-it first. The brainstorm is not shortened for the deadline; the
           deadline is mine to raise with the operator.
MAY        read the repository, upstream sources, the web
WRITE      $S/brainstorm/codex/T8-rdp-audio/draft-codex.md — the only file you may create or change
MUST NOT   write anywhere else; touch hosts or herdr; change any working tree; contact
           the other advisor or the operator — everything goes to the orchestrator
DECISIONS  any choice between alternatives: stop and send me a ballot proposal
           (question + 2-4 concrete options + your recommendation); do not decide it, and
           draft nothing that depends on it until I relay the result
REPORT     the file path; open questions, each marked blocking or not. Compact.
TIME BOX   45 min for this round; do not stall on one path — report and ask
BLOCKED    reply "BLOCKED: <what> <why>" and stop; never work around a guard
```

**Bash, background, two calls in one message:**
```bash
herdr agent prompt prod-codex "$(cat $S/brief-T8-r1-codex.txt)" --wait --timeout 2700000; \
herdr agent read prod-codex --source recent-unwrapped --lines 200 > $S/inbox/prod-codex.last
```
```bash
herdr agent prompt prod-fable "$(cat $S/brief-T8-r1-fable.txt)" --wait --timeout 2700000; \
herdr agent read prod-fable --source recent-unwrapped --lines 200 > $S/inbox/prod-fable.last
```

